<div id="topic1" style="padding:20px;">
<h2>Topic 1: Types of Error</h2>
<p><b>1. Syntax Error:</b> Likhte hi galti, code chalega hi nahi. Ex: {{ product --- }} likh diya.</p>
<p><b>2. Logical Error:</b> Code chalega, jawab galat dega, dhoondhna sabse mushkil. Ex: if(age > 18) ki jagah if(age >= 18) hona tha.</p>
<p><b>3. Runtime Error:</b> Chalte-chalte ruk jayega, isko Exception bhi bolte hai. Ex: c = a + b me a ki value di hi nahi.</p>
</div>

<!-- TOPIC 2 - TRY CATCH -->
<div id="topic2" style="display:none;padding:20px;">
<h2>Topic 2: Try - Catch - Finally - Throw</h2>
<p><b>try:</b> Main code likhte hai, koshish karte hai.</p>
<p><b>catch:</b> Error aaye to pakadte hai, program band nahi hota.</p>
<p><b>finally:</b> Chahe error aaye ya na aaye, ye hamesha chalta hai.</p>
<p><b>throw:</b> Khud se error phenkte hai.</p>
<pre>
try { // main code
  throw "Message"
} catch(e) { // error pakdo
} finally { // hamesha chalega
}
</pre>
</div>

